      "expect_no_answer": false,
      "answer": "[1] src/game/Game.ts:86-100 (method Game.handleGlobalInput)\n```typescript\n  /** Enter starts/restarts; Esc toggles pause. Runs every frame regardless of phase. */\n  private handleGlobalInput(): void {\n    if (this.input.wasPressed(\"confirm\") && (this.phase === \"title\" || this.phase === \"gameOver\")) {\n      this.sound.unlock();\n      this.resetRun();\n      this.setPhase(\"playing\");\n    } else if (this.input.wasPressed(\"pause\")) {\n      if (this.phase === \"playing\") this.setPhase(\"paused\");\n      else if (this.phase === \"paused\") {\n        // Drop time accumulated while paused so the game doesn't jump forward.\n        this.accumulator = 0;\n        this.setPhase(\"playing\");\n      }\n    }\n  }\n```\n\n[2] src/ui/Hud.tsx:8-28 (function Hud)\n```tsx\n/** Score, lives, level and combo, drawn over the canvas. */\nexport function Hud({ store }: HudProps) {\n  const ui = useSyncExternalStore(store.subscribe, store.get);\n  if (ui.phase === \"title\") return null;\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"hud\">\n      <div className=\"hud-left\">\n        <span className=\"score\">{ui.score.toLocaleString()}</span>\n        {ui.comboMultiplier > 1 && <span className=\"combo\">×{ui.comboMultiplier.toFixed(2)}</span>}\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"hud-center\">\n        Lv.{ui.level} {ui.levelName}\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"hud-right\">\n        <Lives count={ui.lives} />\n        <span className={ui.dashReady ? \"dash ready\" : \"dash\"}>DASH</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n[3] src/ui/Hud.tsx:4-6 (interface HudProps)\n```tsx\ninterface HudProps {\n  store: UiStore;\n}\n```\n\n[4] docs/gameplay.md:16-21 (section 玩法規則 > 計分)\n```md\n## 計分\n\n- 收集包裹：基礎 100 分（`PACKAGE_SCORE`）\n- 連續收集包裹會累積連擊，倍率 = 1 + 連擊數 × 0.25，最高 4 倍\n- 超過 `COMBO_WINDOW_MS` 没有收集到包裹，或是受傷，連擊歸零\n- 每存活 1 秒額外加 5 分\n```\n\n遊戲目前沒有存檔功能，最高分會保存在遊戲的狀態中，但並未明確指出存檔的儲存位置或方式。建議查看遊戲的存檔相關文件或與開發團隊確認。",
